  "prefLabel": "En 1204.01 Applicability of Winter Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1204.01 Applicability of Winter Rules. En 1204, Winter Rules, shall apply only to residential customers of public utilities providing gas or electric service in the state of New Hampshire excluding limited electrical energy producers as defined in RSA 362-A. The requirements of this section shall be in addition to those disconnection provisions of En 1203.11 and En 1203.12. Where the circumstances triggering the application of En 1204 and En 1205 occur concurrently, the provisions of En 1205 shall govern.\n\nSource. #13986, eff 5-30-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 1200)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1200.html"
